Thus, the maximum value of the expression is attained when $a_1 = a_2 = \cdots = a_{n-1} = 0$ and $a_n = 1 - \sum_{i=1}^{n-1} a_i = 1 - (n-1)a_n$. In this case, $X = 0$ and

