  [15] To prove that $\{\tan x_1, \tan x_2, \tan x_3\} = \{\tan y_1, \tan y_2, \tan y_3\}$, we will show that the equations derived from the Trigonometric Ceva's Theorem and the given angle sum result in a system of equations that has a unique solution.

